<title>USA: CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 288 contracts.</title>
<headline>CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 288 contracts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Board of Trade said its Project A overnight agricultural volume totaled 288 contracts versus 195 overnight Tuesday.</p>
<p>There were 32 wheat, 108  corn, 85 soybean, 30 soymeal, 25 soyoil, seven rough rice and one corn call.</p>
<p>In overnight trade, wheat was steady to 1-3/4 cents higher, corn was unchanged and soybeans were steady to 1/4 cent firmer.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
